The vocabulary and merge data in this directory (vocab.json, merges.txt,
special_tokens.txt) were extracted from the Mursit tokenizer released by
NewmindAI and are distributed under the Apache License 2.0.

Original repository:
    https://huggingface.co/newmindai/Mursit-Base

Paper:
    Özgür Uğur et al. (2026). "Mecellem Models: Turkish Models Trained from
    Scratch and Continually Pre-trained for the Legal Domain."
    arXiv:2601.16018.

Full license text:
    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
